{"id": "section-body-22231", "title": "Congenital Heart Disease (CHD)", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty", "blocks": [{"id": "body-22231", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Congenital Heart Disease (CHD)", "runs": [{"text": "Congenital"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Heart"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Disease"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(CHD)"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "781"}}, {"id": "body-22232", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "These are structural abnormalities of the heart and intrathoracic blood vessels that occur during fetal development. It is the most common type of birth defect. CHD is divided into non-cyanotic CHD and cyanotic CHD.", "runs": [{"text": "These are structural abnormalities of the heart and intrathoracic blood vessels that occur during fetal development."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "It is the most common type of birth defect. CHD is divided into non-cyanotic CHD and cyanotic CHD."}]}, {"id": "body-22235", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-22236", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Failure to thrive", "runs": [{"text": "Failure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thrive"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "667"}}, {"id": "body-22237", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Interrupted breastfeeding", "runs": [{"text": "Interrupted"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "breastfeeding"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "667"}}, {"id": "body-22238", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Recurrent cough and difficulty in breathing", "runs": [{"text": "Recurrent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cough"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "difficulty"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "breathing"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "667"}}, {"id": "b